"Conan!" you whisper, "the rifle...shoot!"
By shaking hands Conan points father's double-barrelled rifle at the beast... Seconds pass long, agonizingly slow...
Finally, he fires. Hushed jungle is torn by the wild howl. For a second you think that you made it, but the beast seem intact. Conan probably managed to injure it, but the wound is not lethal. Evidently, the beast is furious.
Conan is about to shoot off the second barrel, but at this moment the predator is near. You hear awful screams of your friends and try to flee, but it's too late. Your adventure ends here. 